This product includes software and documentation developed by the IberoLab project.

The provisional reference renderer includes 18 SVG files from the Wikimedia Commons series “Sign Iber Noro Dual 01–38”, created by BotaFlo and released under CC0 1.0 Universal. Their individual source pages, resolved download URLs, local paths, sizes and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in:

  data/signs/reference-standard-dual.assets.v1.json

Additional explanatory information is provided in:

  docs/ASSET_PROVENANCE.md

These normalized reference shapes are not facsimiles of the allographs used in every attested inscription. Other historical forms, bibliographic data and third-party resources may have separate attribution and licensing requirements and must be documented individually before distribution.
